names></name><name><surname>Rutschman</surname><given-names>DH</given-names></name><name><surname>Dumasius</surname><given-names>V</given-names></name><name><surname>Factor</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Sznajder</surname><given-names>JI</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Alveolar type 1 cells express the alpha2 Na, K-ATPase, which contributes to lung liquid clearance</article-title><source>Circ Res</source><year>2003</year><volume>92</volume><fpage>453</fpage><lpage>460</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12600893</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1161/01.RES.0000059414.10360.F2</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>